    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The \"robust\" part is what's making me nervous. I'm thinking about that recent notice we got regarding the data processing patent—the one involving the potential invalidation challenge. If Nebula's legal team starts digging into that specific filing, how do we handle it? We can't let them use it to slash our valuation.",
